Aggregates all 8 forensic eBPF ring buffers in userspace, applies RFC 8785 JSON Canonicalization, computes 64-bit integer nanosecond timestamp parity, derives incremental Merkle tree roots, signs each block with an ECDSA private key, and streams records directly to S3 Object Lock in `COMPLIANCE` mode.

